## Command

```shell
biome lint file.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "javascript": { "experimentalEmbeddedSnippetsEnabled": true },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "correctness": { "noMissingVarFunction": "error" },
      "suspicious": {
        "noDuplicateProperties": "error",
        "noDuplicateCustomProperties": "error"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## `file.js`

```js
const Button = styled.div`
  --size: 1px;
  --size: 2px;
  color: red;
  color: blue;
  width: --size;
  &:hover {
    height: --size;
  }
`;
```

